{"id": 58, "ts": 1780449243.9830112, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 4, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I appreciate Emily\u2019s clarification that Candidate\u202fD\u2019s hot temper and moody, loner reputation translate into a lack of professional communication in team settings. That reinforces my view that D\u2019s strong problem\u2011solving and responsibility traits are outweighed by serious crew\u2011cooperation risks on long\u2011haul flights.\nCandidate\u202fB, while admittedly making occasional nasty remarks, is highly conscientious, handles stress exceptionally well, and excels at weather assessment and computer\u2011based flight planning\u2014key for operational reliability and technical competence. His weak memory for numbers is a noted attention\u2011to\u2011detail gap, but it is a more manageable issue than D\u2019s temper\u2011driven communication breakdowns.\nGiven the comparative evidence, I continue to recommend Candidate\u202fB for the long\u2011distance pilot role."}
